{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 9450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4450, "text": "Hey, old McDonald, how's our future papa\ndoing? I wish that baby would hurry up"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 12750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9450, "text": "and get here. Well, don't be in too much\nof a hurry, Mac. They grow up before"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 13589, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12750, "text": "you know it."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 15490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13590, "text": "Hey, look at my Scooby -Doo lunch pail."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 20250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18570, "text": "Some more slowly than others."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 24980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21650, "text": "Good evening, fellow bailiffs. Uh -oh,\nhide your young."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 31420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26600, "text": "Well, well, well, if it isn't our shop\nsteward, Ethel LaRue. What a pleasant"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 34840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31420, "text": "surprise. Can the crap bail if we both\nknow why I'm here?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 41100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35480, "text": "Once more I am running unopposed for\nshop steward, and we all know how grumpy"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 43760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41100, "text": "get when I win with less than a\nlandslide."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 46560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44660, "text": "Get the drift, my little friend."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 56870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52430, "text": "not actually gonna vote for the wicked\nbailiff of the west oh the job is a lot"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 61210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56870, "text": "of paperwork and drudgery who'd be dumb\nenough to challenge her for that guess"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 68210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61210, "text": "what i'm running for how'd you know we"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 72890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68210, "text": "were just discussing the job\nqualification isn't it great i filed"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 74030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72890, "text": "want to hear my slogan"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 88650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87650, "text": "Hello, boys."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 92710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91030, "text": "Well, Dan, you're in a great mood."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 95710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93490, "text": "Last night, I dated a Jets cheerleader."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 98170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 96610, "text": "And touchdown!"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 104030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101070, "text": "Of course, we did have to go into\novertime."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 108350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105930, "text": "So, Dan, are you going to tell us all\nabout it, or do we have to read it"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 110110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108350, "text": "tomorrow in the supermarket checkout\nline?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 113650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 111770, "text": "Dan Fielding? Yeah, that's me."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 116169, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115310, "text": "It's for you."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 118550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 116170, "text": "Oh, I thank you. Oh, here you are, my\ngood man."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 119970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 118750, "text": "A little something for you."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 123530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 120270, "text": "Hey, now I can get that newspaper I've\nbeen saving up for."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 127430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 126430, "text": "Dad, what is it?"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 131450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128210, "text": "It's a... fraternity suit."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 183800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 180880, "text": "The woman's name is Marilyn Scott, and\nit says here you have a son."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 185060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 184060, "text": "That is impossible."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 186340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185340, "text": "It's some kind of mistake."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 189680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187060, "text": "According to this, your mistake is now\nten years old."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 194700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 192300, "text": "Dan, doesn't the name Marilyn Scott even\nring a bell?"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 196280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 195020, "text": "I wouldn't know her if she bit me."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 199460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 197440, "text": "Then it's no one you've been seeing\nlately, huh?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 205760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 202860, "text": "You have to admit, with all the women\nyou've been going out with, there is a"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 209260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 205760, "text": "possibility that you might have... Hit\nthe mother load?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 215580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 212780, "text": "I am well aware that there are ways of\npreventing this sort of thing from"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 217600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 215580, "text": "happening. So you're saying it's\nimpossible?"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 221980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218520, "text": "Well, I mean, everybody once in a while\ngets caught in a storm without his"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 222980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221980, "text": "umbrella."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 227480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 226480, "text": "Here."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 233860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232120, "text": "That's for your next cloudburst."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 252690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251690, "text": "Hey, you thought of it."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 256430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255310, "text": "There you are."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 258750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256970, "text": "I want a word with you, Shannon."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 260570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259029, "text": "Oh, I guess you heard the good news."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 265250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 260890, "text": "Yeah, well, the good news is I'm going\nto allow you and Pinocchio to withdraw"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 266490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 265250, "text": "from the Wraith intact."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 269290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267790, "text": "Are you threatening me?"}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 275330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269810, "text": "What? As an elected official, I cannot\ncondone any act of violence or"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 276330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 275330, "text": "intimidation."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 282390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277070, "text": "But personally, I'd love nothing better\nthan to strip to the waist and duke it"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 283870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282390, "text": "out with you for a couple of rounds."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 285750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284730, "text": "Get the picture?"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 292490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291490, "text": "Vividly."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 296370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294370, "text": "Then let the best man win."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 304950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303530, "text": "She may have us there."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 313610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310950, "text": "lawyers handle it. From this moment on,\nthat paternity suit is forgotten."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 315650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 314450, "text": "Father knows best."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 321470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319010, "text": "I hope you staple yourself to death."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 325630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324450, "text": "Excuse me."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 328830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327450, "text": "Hey, don't I know you?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 330850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329850, "text": "Car crash?"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 333850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331270, "text": "Collision? Let Petey scrape you out."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 350960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348080, "text": "that commercial for personal injury\nclaims that you do where you freeze"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 353880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350960, "text": "the family of four just before their car\nplunges into the Grand Canyon?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 356660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355060, "text": "Had to get that in one take."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 362060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357760, "text": "I bet. So, Petey, what unspeakable human\nsuffering brings you by?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 364160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362300, "text": "I'm looking for Dan Fielding. That's me."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 366340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365260, "text": "Well, wait a minute."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 371020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 366660, "text": "You're that slimeball lawyer who\ncapitalizes on other people's suffering"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 372120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371020, "text": "misfortune. Yes?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 373800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372700, "text": "I want to shake your hand."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 380010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376520, "text": "You're a sweet... a fortune out of those\npoor slobs. Every penny."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 382990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380290, "text": "I really respect that. I represent\nMarilyn Scott."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 384290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383290, "text": "I want you dead."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 388630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385450, "text": "Mr. Fielding. Listen, I am not going to\nstand here and be accused of something I"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 392770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388630, "text": "didn't do. But Danny, I have affidavits\non you from half the women in this town."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 394390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393010, "text": "You've got quite a reputation."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 398690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 395270, "text": "And I might add that you photograph\nquite well."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 402370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400110, "text": "Yeah, you just try to prove that's me\nbehind that mask."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 408080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404720, "text": "If you refuse to settle, you force me to\nlaunch a vicious, no -holds -barred"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 409080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408080, "text": "smear campaign."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 412780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409220, "text": "Listen, bucko, nobody drags Dan Fielding\nthrough the mud. Not according to"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 414220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412780, "text": "action photo number five."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 422540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 418500, "text": "Danny, Dan, Dan, by fighting this, you\nsimply prolong your agony, deplete your"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 428420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422540, "text": "assets, alienate your friends. You find\nyourself thrashing about in a morass of"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 432340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428420, "text": "despair from which death itself is the\nonly escape."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 435070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433390, "text": "Well, time for my facial."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 436650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435650, "text": "Ciao."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 443330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440430, "text": "Boy, he's a lot nicer in person than he\nis on TV."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 450590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447430, "text": "What was that?"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 453930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450950, "text": "I don't know. You suppose they let Roz\ndo the strip search again?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 466260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465260, "text": "It should have been me."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 470320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467560, "text": "Oh, Bull, I am so sorry."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 473620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470600, "text": "He was only a sapling."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 477440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476440, "text": "What's this?"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 479260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477480, "text": "A note. I'll read it."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 486060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481480, "text": "Drop out of the race, or next time, the\nreal dummy gets it."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 490340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489240, "text": "Ethel LaRue."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 492680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490640, "text": "Bull, I'm sure he can be revived."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 495220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493240, "text": "It's too late. I already tried mouth -to\n-mouth."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 500140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496960, "text": "So you screamed when... I got a splinter\nin my tongue."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 505400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503620, "text": "Maybe my daddy can fix him."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 506820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505820, "text": "Who's your daddy?"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 524049, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523049, "text": "to you too, Petey."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 529050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525310, "text": "I got a hold of that lawyer. He should\nbe slithering by here shortly."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 531950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529610, "text": "The kid has certainly gotten attached to\nDan."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 533230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532230, "text": "Uh -huh."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 542890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540090, "text": "Are you tired of writing Mr. Prosecutor\nyet?"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 547790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544550, "text": "I'm not going to have hair like you when\nI grow up, am I?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 551910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548790, "text": "You're not going to grow up unless you\nget off my floor shimes, kid."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 557340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553500, "text": "My name is a kid. My name is Brian, and\nI'm not getting off till you agree to"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 558540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557340, "text": "talk to me. Forget it."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 561880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559080, "text": "Okay, if you won't talk to me, at least\nbuy me an ice cream."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 562979, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562080, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 566820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562980, "text": "Did I mention I have to go to the\nbathroom real bad?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 571380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570220, "text": "One scoop or two."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 574000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572640, "text": "Come on, race to cafeteria."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 578200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574660, "text": "Yeah, don't run too fast, otherwise you\nmight fall and break your widow neck."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 583610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580120, "text": "Dan, try to be nice. to him or he'll\nonly have something to hold against you"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 585830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583610, "text": "court. Right. I won't leave any marks."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 590690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589690, "text": "There he goes."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 591870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590870, "text": "Daddy dearest."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 595030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594030, "text": "I don't know."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 597690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595410, "text": "Believe it or not, I think Dan can make\na very good father."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 603970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599270, "text": "Hello. Are we talking about the same Dan\nFielding who lobbied to infate leash"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 605110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603970, "text": "laws for children?"}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 607970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606970, "text": "No, I'm serious."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 612490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608550, "text": "Underneath that... marmy sex craze\nexterior lies another dan fielding"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 648960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 646320, "text": "You want to play a little game? It's\ncalled civilization."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 654440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651880, "text": "I take it you haven't been around kids\nmuch."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 656540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655140, "text": "Call it a life's ambition."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 660280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658980, "text": "Can I ask you a question?"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 661600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660600, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 663220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 662060, "text": "Why did you leave us?"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 667020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663500, "text": "I didn't leave you. I wasn't there in\nthe first place."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 672280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667740, "text": "Now listen, kids, and listen good. There\nis no possible way I could be your"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 673280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672280, "text": "father."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 676010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674640, "text": "You mean... you're gay."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 684470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682590, "text": "Okay, technically it's possible."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 688090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685430, "text": "Look, trust me, you wouldn't want me as\nyour father anyway."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 689449, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688490, "text": "Why not?"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 690450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689450, "text": "I hate you."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 693290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692290, "text": "Good point."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 696050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694690, "text": "But I don't hate you."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 697970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696730, "text": "Stick around, you will."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 703610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699810, "text": "In fact, I love you."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 713960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712240, "text": "love me. You don't even know me."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 720820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714900, "text": "But I... But I... But I... Listen to me,\nkid. You cannot love somebody you've"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 721820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720820, "text": "never met."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 723120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722120, "text": "That's not true."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 726160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723860, "text": "Okay, there's a few phone services, but\nthat's it."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 734660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729640, "text": "Look, all I'm saying is that if you were\nmy father, I'd love you, all right? All"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 736140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734660, "text": "right, fine, fine. You ready?"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 739600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736580, "text": "And if you had a kid, you'd love him,\ntoo, wouldn't you?"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 744440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740440, "text": "Like I said earlier, Children should\nbe... Genetically cloned in factories,"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 745640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744640, "text": "yeah."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 746980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745980, "text": "Good,"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 749120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747700, "text": "then I've taught you well. Let's go."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 752380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749780, "text": "Dan? Oh, what is it now?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 759220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757500, "text": "Will I die without a father?"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 764300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763300, "text": "You're weird."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 773110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772110, "text": "How the hell should I know?"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 780230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777270, "text": "Hey, hey, hey, hey, don't do that. Don't\ndo that. Don't sit there with that lost"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 781230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780230, "text": "puppy dog look."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 789450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782790, "text": "I didn't mean to. Yeah, well... No."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 791730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790470, "text": "Of course you didn't."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 803480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802220, "text": "Yeah, oh, yeah, yeah, I'm fine."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 805820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 803700, "text": "Happy as a freckle on Daryl Hannah's\nbody."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 811680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 809900, "text": "That's the first thing you've said, I\nunderstand."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 816440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814460, "text": "This kid stuff really spooked you, huh?"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 819600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818600, "text": "No, not really."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 822740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821020, "text": "The parent stuff that's frightening."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 825160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 824160, "text": "How come?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 830240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828540, "text": "Because I see it every day around here."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 837780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833000, "text": "Mommy and daddy's eyes filled with tears\nas they come to bail their baby out of"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 838780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837780, "text": "jail."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 842220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841140, "text": "Report them missing."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 847540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 846540, "text": "Identify their body."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 852780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851780, "text": "Couldn't handle that kid."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 856180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854500, "text": "Couldn't even live with the possibility."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 862400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861400, "text": "What if I..."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 864240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862540, "text": "I'll never get sick or hurt."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 868600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866580, "text": "Excuse me, I think I hear Rod Serling\ncalling."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 874140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871080, "text": "If I do get sick or hurt, I won't even\ntell you, I promise."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 877120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 875340, "text": "You don't even have to care."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 881800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880460, "text": "I'll take what I can get."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 891060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890040, "text": "What happened here?"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 892630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891630, "text": "He was murdered."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 895170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 893810, "text": "Wrongful death, I'm your man."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 902190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 900350, "text": "So, where's the kid?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 903790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 902790, "text": "He's with Dan."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 906970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904470, "text": "Any chance he kidnapped the boy?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 909810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908610, "text": "I'm telling you the truth."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 911070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910070, "text": "Really? Yes."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 912370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911370, "text": "What are you guys talking about?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 913730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912730, "text": "Grocery stores."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 914830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913830, "text": "Oh, how nice."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 919290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915190, "text": "Yeah, Dan told me how you can tell how\nloose a woman is by the way she picks"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 920290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 919290, "text": "produce."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 924460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923240, "text": "Oh, Dan, you didn't."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 927840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925660, "text": "Bet you she never thumped a honeydew in\nher life."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 933000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930680, "text": "You're in big trouble, buddy. I'm gonna\nnail you to the wall."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 936720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933200, "text": "Peterson, I'm ready to settle. Yeah, I'm\ngonna skin you alive. I'm gonna crucify"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 938220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936720, "text": "you. I'm gonna beg your pardon."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 941640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940020, "text": "Dan, you're gonna settle?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 943580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942340, "text": "What are you talking about, Dan?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 944980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943980, "text": "You heard me."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 950240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945480, "text": "If a test shows even a possibility that\nthe boy is mine, I want to take full"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 951240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950240, "text": "responsibility."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 956190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953130, "text": "Why, Dan, that's... Noble?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 961650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959030, "text": "Yeah, the word got stuck in my throat."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 964430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963250, "text": "Where's my baby?"}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 965889, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965070, "text": "Hi, Mom."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 968150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965890, "text": "Oh, honey, are you okay?"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 971890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968870, "text": "Yeah, I'm okay. What did I tell you I\nlearned about grocery stores?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 974530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973070, "text": "Honey, what are you doing here?"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 976070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974770, "text": "I came to see my dad."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 981030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976750, "text": "Great news. We got Papa right where we\nwant him. He's going to settle out of"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 982030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981030, "text": "court."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 992340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 991080, "text": "That's not Stan Fielding."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 998000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996480, "text": "Dan Fielding?"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 1000600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998400, "text": "Dan Stan, what's the difference?"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 1004900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001960, "text": "Shut up. He's willing to pay through the\nnose, and you need the money"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 1007320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004900, "text": "desperately. But that's not the father\nof my son."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 1008980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007680, "text": "He's not my father?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 1010640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1009380, "text": "No, honey, he's not."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 1016380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014620, "text": "Marilyn, are you out of your mind?"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 1018720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017720, "text": "Carolyn."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 1020620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019620, "text": "Really?"}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 1027419, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026440, "text": "lady, let me."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 1030420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1027420, "text": "I know every nook and cranny in this\nbuilding a body can fit into."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1056400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054440, "text": "Boys just got into the sacramental line,\nsure."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1059880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058000, "text": "What the hell do you think you're doing?"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1061180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060180, "text": "It's none of your business."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1063580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061780, "text": "Hey, sit."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1066180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1063840, "text": "I'm going to see my lawyer. See this\nlawyer."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1070820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069820, "text": "Now, look."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1078640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072880, "text": "Things like this, well, they seem to\nalways have a way of working out for the"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1079640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078640, "text": "best."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1098140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096140, "text": "I feel pretty confused."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1101840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099860, "text": "Confused? Why would I feel confused?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1106580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102440, "text": "Just because this morning I didn't have\na father, this afternoon I did have a"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1108460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1106580, "text": "father, and now I don't have a father\nagain."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1110180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108680, "text": "Hey, who cares? Hey, hey!"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1112240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111240, "text": "Get back here."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1115000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113680, "text": "Who do you think you are?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1116740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115280, "text": "And you had a tough break."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1121460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117120, "text": "Listen, sometimes tough breaks turn out\nto be lucky breaks. And what starts off"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1124580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121460, "text": "as the worst day in your life can turn\nout to be the best day in your life."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1128100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125640, "text": "Why are you telling me this? I have the\nfaintest idea."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1134500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133500, "text": "It's not true."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1138960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134860, "text": "I'm telling you because... I like you."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1141720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140720, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1145280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144260, "text": "I like you."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1146940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145940, "text": "You do?"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1151150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148170, "text": "What, you barge into my life, you eat\ntwo quarts of ice cream, you suction"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1155070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151150, "text": "yourself to my hip, you threaten to\nrelieve yourself on my loafers."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1157550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156490, "text": "What's not to like?"}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1160370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1159370, "text": "I like you too."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1163530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162530, "text": "So?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1166210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165210, "text": "So."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1172030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171030, "text": "What do we do now?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1176510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1173070, "text": "We could be best friends, and I could\ncome over to your house and play every"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1177510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1176510, "text": "day."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1184260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182760, "text": "Why don't I just write you a check\ninstead?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1185660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184660, "text": "Huh?"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1188760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1186700, "text": "Well, kids need things, don't they?"}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1194120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190240, "text": "Scarves, mittens, those really silly\n-looking galoshes."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1196200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194840, "text": "A new baseball mitt?"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1200200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197600, "text": "Yeah, and a new baseball mitt."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1202640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201640, "text": "Here."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1204280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203260, "text": "This is for you."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1209240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205380, "text": "Wow, $1 ,000 for a baseball mitt?"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1211400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1210080, "text": "Get a bat, too."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1214970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213130, "text": "Your mother will know what to do with\nthe rest of it."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1218410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217110, "text": "Can I see something personal?"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1221650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220650, "text": "Yeah, go ahead."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1228630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1227370, "text": "Can I see your balance?"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1237290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1235790, "text": "That's my boy."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1256770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254510, "text": "bone to pick with you about a friend of\nmine."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1260510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1259510, "text": "Oh, yeah?"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1263670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1260890, "text": "Would that friend happen to be a sack of\nsawdust?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1266030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263970, "text": "You lowdown conniving puppet killer!"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1268030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1266810, "text": "I demand an apology."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1269329, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268370, "text": "Oh, yeah?"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1270330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269330, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1272610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271610, "text": "You got it."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1274750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273750, "text": "Huh?"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1277810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275570, "text": "Congratulations. You're the new shop\nsteward."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1279890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278690, "text": "What are you talking about?"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1281390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280110, "text": "The election's not until tomorrow."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1283790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282050, "text": "Yeah, but it's all over for me."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1287540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284520, "text": "I heard through the polls that you're\ngoing to win by a landslide."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1293380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289600, "text": "I guess you deserve to after what I did\nto poor little Kermit the Log."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1297800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1296600, "text": "Why'd you do it, LaRue?"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1302140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298960, "text": "Shannon, what you saw was the act of a\ndesperate woman."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1305600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303940, "text": "Without my job, I'm nobody."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1307960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306660, "text": "I got no friend."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1310640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309060, "text": "Got no social life."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1319160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1313040, "text": "That job was the only thing that I had\ngoing for me in the whole wide world."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1325540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323360, "text": "I had no idea it meant so much to you."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1332920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325920, "text": "LaRue, if you want the"}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1333920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332920, "text": "job, it's yours."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1339520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1336480, "text": "What? I think you're the best man for\nthe job."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1341440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340160, "text": "I'm withdrawing from the race."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1348110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343950, "text": "You'd do that for me, a woman that\ntreated you so rotten?"}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1349890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348710, "text": "I'm funny that way."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1354170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1352150, "text": "I don't know what to say."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1360470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1359870, "text": "And"}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1367290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360470, "text": "there's more"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1368810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367290, "text": "where that comes from."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1382800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380140, "text": "Fail denied. Let's hold this one over\nfor the grand jury."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1385400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1383420, "text": "And that's all she wrote, folks."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1386880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1385880, "text": "About time."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1389820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1387920, "text": "Business as usual tonight, Dan?"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1392460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1390080, "text": "Yeah, tonight it's Giselle, the hot oil\nwrestler."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1396640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1394060, "text": "Oh, yeah, she's the one with\nwethenality."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1403680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1399420, "text": "Dan, I know this may be a waste of\nbreath, but..."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1408010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1404750, "text": "I just wanted you to know that the way\nyou handled that boy showed a lot of"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1409470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1408010, "text": "warmth and human compassion."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1413570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1412170, "text": "I bet you're not wearing a bra."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1418190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1417190, "text": "You're a pig."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1429590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1426930, "text": "I'm sorry I'm late. I thought they'd\nnever let me out of there."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1431489, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1430630, "text": "That's okay."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1433590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1431490, "text": "The game isn't started yet. We're all\nset."}
